<newsitem itemid="230720" id="root" date="1996-12-03" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Transpaco raises interim shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Transpaco raises interim shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     8.01	   vs   7.16</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.88	   vs   0.79</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.22	   vs   1.01</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.33	   vs   0.23</p>
<p>    Finance costs	   0.87	   vs   0.82</p>
<p>    Turnover		 33.22	   vs   32.79</p>
<p>Full name: Transpaco Ltd (paper and packaging)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said although the group was performing well, the directors felt it was not prudent to declare an interim dividend.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
